WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050 line:95%,end
My father co-founded the company 35 years ago,

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:11.490 line:95%,end
and since then he served as the CEO until last December,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.750 line:95%,end
when he retired. A couple of years earlier, we started to think about the

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:23.660 line:95%,end
succession planning, and it became quite obvious that the company would be sold.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:29.930 line:95%,end
We were talking with several potential buyers,

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:37.590 line:95%,end
and with PubliX we got a good feeling that they will also help us in the succession.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:46.050 line:95%,end
Myself being quite a bit younger, and not having worked as a CEO before,

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:52.650 line:95%,end
they really helped me with support in this –

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.350 line:95%,end
a bit broader shoulders than myself –

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.150 line:95%,end
helping in both day-to-day operations and more strategic topics.
